Third-party attributions
-------------------------

This repository embeds a small number of verbatim, Apache-2.0-licensed configuration and
show-command files as test fixtures only. They live under tests/fixtures/third-party/<source>/,
each directory carrying the upstream LICENSE and a SOURCE.md naming the pinned commit and the
exact upstream path; tests/fixtures/ATTRIBUTION.md lists them file by file. None of them is
shipped in the skill package (skills/cisco-switch-config/), whose worked examples are
hand-authored for this project. See docs/content-provenance.md for the full policy.

